<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74193" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνῠχ-ίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pare the nails.</i> in 
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Mis.</u>
				339b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>VP</u>
				28.154
			</span></i> : aor 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠνυχισάμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>2 Ki.</u>
					19.24(25)
				</span></i>
			 :—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠνυχισμένος</span>”
				<i>with one's nails pared,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					455
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. ὄνυχας</span>”
				<i>to have the hoof cloven,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Le.</u>
					11.7
				</span></i>
			, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>examine with the nail, examine closely,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Artem.
				4
			</span></i>
			<u>Prooem.</u>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				5.162c
			</span></i> : fut.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνυχιεῖ: ἐπιμελῶς ἐξετάσει,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> :—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνυχίζεται,</span> expld. by <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκριβολογεῖται,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				834
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>overreach,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇ συνηθείᾳ -ίζεσθαί φαμεν τὸν
					ἐπὶ βλάβῃ ὑπό τινος ἐξαπατηθέντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Artem.
					1.22
				</span></i>
			.</div>
